# AppSync Architecture

## Overview

This document describes the AppSync GraphQL architecture used in the SaySo platform. The AppSync API, Cognito User Pool, GraphQL schema, and Lambda resolvers are all defined in `who-knows-aws-services` (app repository). The platform repository (`tnm-aws-platform`) provides only the underlying infrastructure: VPC, subnets, RDS Proxy, and Aurora database.

This separation follows domain-driven architecture principles where the app team owns the full application stack while the platform team owns the shared infrastructure.

